# The song each scene starts after it has begun, recorded on the console: a
# cutscene's animation object starts it a few frames in (the character demo's
# title theme). The scene gate makes the first one listed resident before the
# scene starts. Songs a level starts itself are loaded with the level and are
# not listed. A song missing here still plays: it loads when it starts.
